          "description": "Input is newline separated text. Split with splitlines(); strip each line; discard blank lines; remove duplicates by casefold preserving first trimmed spelling and order. Return compact JSON using ensure_ascii=False and separators=(\",\",\":\") with keys exactly in this order: items (list), count (integer). Implement main.py and a separate reusable helper module; no file, process or network operations.",
          "name": "为个人助手新增可复用的清单整理能力：编写多文件 Python 工具，去除空行、修剪首尾空格、按 Unicode casefold 忽略大小写去重，保留首次出现的文本及顺序，并交付整理后的清单。",
